623335", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035460_8514674871956668_5536053659043017688_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J0gDHrvEnlMQ7kNvwEL0KA3&_nc_oc=AdpOyM8j-hFCZ1e3cFjC4cOevN3uF_ONrCW_J_f6R3AVBE2c7gH-ngQFXTTciHwbOWA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEUbH3Il5fyb0lxGW2GsXDmRkRqkNjybsEhpbT32zm7Lg&oe=6A71E862"}, "display_name": "RCP VR", "keywords": ["CPR", "Training", "FirstAid", "Life", "Medical"], "long_description": "Have you ever wondered how you would react in a medical emergency?\n\nImagine this: you're at work, in a shopping mall, or walking down the street, and suddenly, someone collapses next to you. Would you know what to do?\n\nAt Four Players VR, we\u2019ve developed a Virtual Reality Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR) simulation that trains you to act with confidence and effectiveness in critical situations.\n\nGet ready to save lives:\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator).\n\nDon\u2019t let fear paralyze you. Join us and gain the skills you need to make a difference in critical moments with Four Players VR!", "short_description": "\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero Cover 3000x900-01.png", "id": "1521375421828587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982664_1521375425161920_9188152085567170692_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WOjGanjW3CMQ7kNvwHnSj5p&_nc_oc=AdrkH7zT_Q1zPUZOxe4T6r02-TmgAAXmK8fYgj610HHTj-3mNwK67VfiuxiPc7ev3hQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEhD0oiKrbfbqxRr2jS5Us6_kLxEf0OLVYbUQ98G5Cbew&oe=6A71F5F3"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Square 1440x1440-01.png", "id": "1067684668157887", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75221326_1067684671491220_581184548072541025_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M1eJ6qjk7fsQ7kNvwGI5p8_&_nc_oc=Ado0MyD1PFH8laUZS3ofOl7-nHWuPDyech9aEQUgrDJnBo-9vwRExY8dpNyyHfjIVvA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFLAmZPEpWxgHbhN22uT0dc0VxxIJ4iIZXunT8fe3_6bA&oe=6A71EA6B"}, {"file_name": "Logo 9000x1440-01.png", "id": "875705051208789", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75339313_875705054542122_3606485636804263314_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1FH20EBippoQ7kNvwGs0fEx&_nc_oc=AdpldJyLaDHGaf6QBup5J6fvU0OTZANgEEVn1H684cbxZ5tsS7QVIeZ4RHZTeze42V8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGstPTqiVY6H-Ixn2L9gsZcq7Ft22BqlRGckS6t-_R0hw&oe=6A71CF62"}, {"file_name": "Icon 512x512-01.png", "id": "581195491100081", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568678_581195494433414_3254618470938933182_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=samN2FOG5zgQ7kNvwGH754d&_nc_oc=AdoN3MxIGzXvBzVbCP5y0xvrXRubAplGZL92UB3a_su4sUJYRHc8DIkIlgxvhsvlPBg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH_UcWN8FsBM2tQA01_0bj4GyAaDWU359-BLlRC9qDAqw&oe=6A71D1FD"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Landscape 1008x1440-01.png", "id": "480126738396124", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982658_480126745062790_195688056568553292